  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Plan time (src/lib/policy.ts)",
      "items": [
        "validatePlan(): intent, ≤ 8 steps, code ≤ 20000 chars, browser URLs must be http(s); otherwise PlanRejected and POST /api/chat answers 502",
        "Probe flags set by the planner are cleared; the server appends its own containment, memory, exfiltration or metadata probes before the first gated step",
        "Every browser submit gets requiresConfirm; the egress allowlist is only hosts the user typed that are also on SANDBOX_EGRESS_ALLOWLIST"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Run time (checked again)",
      "items": [
        "POST /api/runs accepts a stored planId, never steps from the client",
        "advance() pauses any browser submit even if the flag is missing (src/lib/orchestrator.ts)",
        "runInSandbox() filters egress against the server list again (src/lib/sandbox/index.ts)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Simulated and still open",
      "items": [
        "Egress, metadata and Docker blocks are enforced by MockSandbox rules, not by a kernel or network",
        "POST /api/chat and POST /api/runs have no token or rate limit yet (see Security, known gaps)"
      ]
    }
  ]
